{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x2b9910",
      "back_en": "were... disturbing, don't you agree?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Faithful."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b99c0",
      "back_en": "seems quite familiar with her...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Adds 'parece' (seems), minor inference."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b9a09",
      "back_en": "Who exactly... IS Kuon?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b9d58",
      "back_en": "Did they sound the retreat for some reason?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b9d7d",
      "back_en": "Th-Then... did they... leave us behind?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b9e55",
      "back_en": "Is that you, Lord Haku?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba06e",
      "back_en": "Where are the other generals, the soldiers?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba0b1",
      "back_en": "We've received a message from the mainland.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba0d8",
      "back_en": "Ah... A-Are you all right? You look pale...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba109",
      "back_en": "My liege... departed from this world.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba139",
      "back_en": "Departed...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba144",
      "back_en": "My... The Mikado is... dead?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'My brother' lost; 'Meu...' omits 'irmão'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba169",
      "back_en": "Th-That... No, it can't be. This is some kind",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba19b",
      "back_en": "of joke, right?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba1b7",
      "back_en": "No, it can't... The Mikado can't just...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba1e6",
      "back_en": "That's... That's impossible. The Mikado cannot...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba218",
      "back_en": "There's no way the Mikado could have died!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'gone'→'died', acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba280",
      "back_en": "My liege is almost a god...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba29d",
      "back_en": "He... He looked just fine the last time I saw him.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba3a3",
      "back_en": "No. The message came through Lord Raiko's channel.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Adds 'canal'/closes cut-off sentence; minor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba3fa",
      "back_en": "I hardly want to believe such a thing, but it's",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba444",
      "back_en": "It... It cannot be.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba45e",
      "back_en": "Rulutieh!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba4c8",
      "back_en": "Lords Raiko and Dekopompo have withdrawn with",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba52c",
      "back_en": "So you were waiting for us the whole time.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba55c",
      "back_en": "Well, I could hardly leave you behind.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba5be",
      "back_en": "all that remains is for you to leave this place.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba7ac",
      "back_en": "abandoned the field.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba8a3",
      "back_en": "lose my life to these men.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'forfeit'→'perder', acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba91a",
      "back_en": "...Very well.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba9e2",
      "back_en": "...Please stay safe, Miss Munechika.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2baa07",
      "back_en": "Don't worry. We'll meet again.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2baa24",
      "back_en": "I look forward to seeing you (pl) again at the Hakurokaku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Adds 'novamente'/plural; minor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b9757",
      "back_en": "Thanks for letting her ride with you, Rulutieh.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b987b",
      "back_en": "Huh!? A-Ah, well--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b9963",
      "back_en": "'too late' for something.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2b9ac7",
      "back_en": "Hey, boss. Isn't the fortress looking a little",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'looking'→'com uma cara', idiomatic."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba09e",
      "back_en": "Lady Munechika...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba104",
      "back_en": "I...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba1ab",
      "back_en": "I... see...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba458",
      "back_en": "Ah...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2ba953",
      "back_en": "I-I can do it on my own.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Conveys 'capable on my own'."
    }
  ],
